Jakarta X Beauty is a three-day event in
Central Jakarta that brings together

00:00:20.850 --> 00:00:24.779
brands, beauty content creators and
beauty lovers the event was spread

00:00:24.779 --> 00:00:29.519
across three venues with 120 brands
participating there's lots of shopping

00:00:29.519 --> 00:00:34.770
deals and promotions there's also loads
of interesting talks with over 80

00:00:34.770 --> 00:00:40.260
speakers participating this year I did
two talks one was on hyperpigmentation

00:00:40.260 --> 00:00:44.850
with Kae we talked about the difference
between brightening and whitening and

00:00:44.850 --> 00:00:50.129
how to safely even out your skin tone I
also did a talk about acne with Dr

00:00:50.129 --> 00:00:54.660
Arini we talked about different types
of acne what contributes to acne and how

00:00:54.660 --> 00:00:58.620
to treat different types of acne as well
one of the things we talked about was

00:00:58.620 --> 00:01:02.579
how to squeeze a pimple properly or by
properly we mean with the least amount

00:01:02.579 --> 00:01:06.330
of damage because officially you
shouldn't squeeze your pimples you

00:01:06.330 --> 00:01:10.140
should go to a dermatologist who can do
it properly with the least amount of

00:01:10.140 --> 00:01:14.220
risk because if you don't squeeze a
pimple right it can lead to scarring and

00:01:14.220 --> 00:01:18.720
further infection but of course we live
in the real world where people squeeze

00:01:18.720 --> 00:01:23.159
their own pimples we can't all just wait
the three-month waiting time to go to a

00:01:23.159 --> 00:01:27.570
dermatologist sometimes you just can't
help yourself so here's how to do it

00:01:27.570 --> 00:01:33.270
with the least amount of harm so this is
a harm minimization video for what to do

00:01:33.270 --> 00:01:43.020
if you must squeeze your pimples firstly
you want to make sure you're squeezing

00:01:43.020 --> 00:01:47.250
the right types of pimples and what this
means is waiting till the pimple comes

00:01:47.250 --> 00:01:51.540
to a head with visible pus
if there's no visible pus you're

00:01:51.540 --> 00:01:55.530
squeezing hoping that something will
come out there might not actually be

00:01:55.530 --> 00:01:59.399
anything in there to come out and so
you're just squeezing and causing extra

00:01:59.399 --> 00:02:02.509
damage for no reason

00:02:05.420 --> 00:02:10.170
secondly this is pretty obvious but you
should do it hygienically you are

00:02:10.170 --> 00:02:13.270
opening up a wound on your skin and so
you

00:02:13.270 --> 00:02:17.890
want it to be as clean as possible what
this means is clean skin and clean

00:02:17.890 --> 00:02:22.600
fingers to clean your skin you should
wash it and then wipe it with alcohol to

00:02:22.600 --> 00:02:26.440
clean your fingers obviously you need to
wash your hands you can also wear gloves

00:02:26.440 --> 00:02:31.360
and you can also cover your fingernails
with a bit of tissue and so that gives

00:02:31.360 --> 00:02:35.170
you a better grip as well you can also
use cotton buds instead to do the

00:02:35.170 --> 00:02:44.770
squeezing the next thing you want is to
lance your pimple before you squeeze it

00:02:44.770 --> 00:02:49.270
and what this means is to stab it with a
needle so that there's a passageway for

00:02:49.270 --> 00:02:53.650
the pus to come out the needle should be
sharp so that you make a hole as small

00:02:53.650 --> 00:02:57.220
as possible without causing extra damage
from pressure the needle should

00:02:57.220 --> 00:03:01.630
obviously also be clean so you can use a
brand new needle out of a sterile

00:03:01.630 --> 00:03:06.310
package you can also sterilize a needle
yourself so for example you can pass it

00:03:06.310 --> 00:03:10.150
through a flame and wipe it down with
alcohol so here's something that was new

00:03:10.150 --> 00:03:14.920
to me you should lance your pimple at
an angle if you stab it straight down

00:03:14.920 --> 00:03:18.610
what you might be doing is introducing
pus at the surface deeper into the

00:03:18.610 --> 00:03:23.500
pimple you want to lance it add an angle
or even better horizontally so that

00:03:23.500 --> 00:03:32.830
there's no chance of the pus going
deeper into uninfected skin when you're

00:03:32.830 --> 00:03:37.150
squeezing you don't want to use too much
pressure if you use too much pressure

00:03:37.150 --> 00:03:46.750
you're causing extra damage that's
unnecessary with squeezing your pimple

00:03:46.750 --> 00:03:52.980
you should stop when clear liquid or
blood comes out when all the pus is out

00:03:55.800 --> 00:04:00.490
finally once you finish squeezing wipe
it off with either a clean piece of

00:04:00.490 --> 00:04:05.560
tissue or even an alcohol pad and you
can also cover it up with a bandage for

00:04:05.560 --> 00:04:09.970
example a hydrocolloid bandage to stop
any extra infection going into your

00:04:09.970 --> 00:04:15.190
freshly cleaned pimple so those are our
tips on squeezing a pimple I hope you

00:04:15.190 --> 00:04:19.540
enjoyed this video if you did please hit
like and subscribe to my channel you can

00:04:19.540 --> 00:04:23.680
also follow me on Instagram and check
out my blog for more beauty science let

00:04:23.680 --> 00:04:25.540
me know what you want me to talk about
next time

00:04:25.540 --> 00:04:31.590
and I will see you later don't squeeze
too much

